{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About The Demo</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The demo features four condensed turns from the prologue of [Contract Cafe], offering approximately one hour of gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Please note that save data from the demo cannot be transferred to the full version.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Some aspects of this demo may differ from the full version in terms of content or appearance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contract Cafe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The story takes place in a city on a continent where you, as Riko, the current manager of the caf\u00e9, receive a letter from an old friend. You promise to take care of a mysterious girl, Niya, bringing her into your world, sharing special moments with her, and helping her grow. In the beginning, whether it's your bond with Niya, joyful days with your team, or the peculiar stories from the shop, they all fill your life with happiness and warmth... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The caf\u00e9 plays an irreplaceable role for everyone involved. You have to work hard to keep it running for Niya and for all the people around you. At the same time, a super powerful company that economically controls the city is watching and waiting to show its claws... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The truth about Niya's past, the challenges faced by your friends, the troubles in society, and the conflicts between humans and other beings all unfold in your caf\u00e9, making it the center of an unfolding drama...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage and Run Your Caf\u00e9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075820/extras/96e98dde98c7afa16ad136c9eb0e319d.poster.avif?t=1760599029\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075820/extras/96e98dde98c7afa16ad136c9eb0e319d.webm?t=1760599029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075820/extras/96e98dde98c7afa16ad136c9eb0e319d.mp4?t=1760599029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live freely in this city</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075820/extras/96e98dde98c7afa16ad136c9eb0e319d.poster.avif?t=1760599029\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075820/extras/96e98dde98c7afa16ad136c9eb0e319d.webm?t=1760599029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075820/extras/96e98dde98c7afa16ad136c9eb0e319d.mp4?t=1760599029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore this evolving city, befriend a variety of customers, keep up with the latest coffee trends through casual chats and news, and improve and upgrade your struggling coffee shop by acquiring new supplies and equipment. Turn your little shop into a special spot in the city and immerse yourself in the story!&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful and diverse characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\